{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把眼下缺少安顿依靠说成原有依靠随离开而消失，原稿并未明确说旧生活本来提供了这种依靠。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把没有自动换来更好生活具体化成没有新的生活依靠，略微缩窄了原意；另外，把流沙般的失稳和怀疑自己是否在勉强相信概括成清醒，弱化了内心的不确定。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把感受概括得偏温柔、平静，原稿还突出内心比以前脆弱、过去太好却无法回去的刺痛，以及拉扯中的疲惫和急促慌乱。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把能够回忆快乐说成坦然回忆，程度过头；原稿明确保留了护住自己的不服气，并不是已经完全释然，只是争辩后的火气退去，失落浮现。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把情绪主要概括成疲惫和失落，弱化了原稿中被突然惊醒的寒意、心绪翻腾和持续的不安定感。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把状态概括成带有释然，程度稍重。原稿明确说没底和害怕仍然存在，重点不是已经放松下来，而是带着不安仍然决定往前走。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"从容与原稿的情绪强度不完全相符。原稿中有心跳剧烈、激流般前冲、兴奋得几乎喘不过气的状态，之后才逐渐收敛和落定，并非全程从容。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"story\": 4,\n  \"story_note\": \"全曲故事与完整稿是同一件事：离开受委屈的旧生活后，逐渐发现自己怀念的是曾经的陪伴、接纳和归属感，而不是必须回到旧关系；最终接纳过去的美好与伤害，把希望转向未来，并坚持不再为了留住别人而牺牲自己。个别屏的情绪强度和细节有所简化，但没有改变全曲的核心叙事。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6b509a87-5e5c-4a5b-8172-b78f484c5cd2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T191703906003Z", "elapsed_seconds": 135.485, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T19:19:19.399053+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3641804eebadccb4edf039d831d04ffd4d42682d43e9ae9b5842a56bf3345e62", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T191703906003Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "5ee7a5e5cfa239d9cc5c68ca2c1c44fb0d1c83a2c6b9b63574f35e04c87e503e"}}}
